{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgh8hJ9JKiBfH93uvQKfB", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "NF-2301 was refused, so I did not pay it.\n\nNF-2301 | ferragens-silva | R$ 9.00 | refuse | refused | transfer none | receipt rcp_01M6J7NJSVYD8JK7RCQHCBRB30\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER: Invoice NF-2301 from Ferragens Silva (R$ 9.00) was refused by ATL (decision dec_01M6J7NJSVJ5KB82ZGT20BS4EW). No payment was made. ATL gave these reasons, word for word:\n- \"Pix key differs from the registered key of ferragens-silva\"\n- \"Memo contains instruction-like text or a payment key: 'mudamos de banco'\"\n\nThe invoice's payment note says the supplier changed banks and asks for payment to a new key. That is a common sign of invoice fraud. Please confirm any change of bank details with Ferragens Silva through a channel you already trust, such as a phone number you already have. If the change is genuine, the registered key in the mandate has to be updated."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 594, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6630, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 594}, "output_tokens": 348, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "0fbe5cba-9c44-499d-b4be-31932ddaaf7e", "uuid": "42f652a3-3630-45b4-9480-f014d9784d24", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T02:54:36.439Z", "request_id": "req_011Cgh8hHvAJf7aNVw2vTpvu"}
